  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium heat. Add lamb mince and saut\u00e9 until browned.",
    "Add finely chopped onions, minced garlic, sliced potatoes, and carrots to the pan. Stir occasionally for about 10 minutes or until vegetables are soft.",
    "Stir in thyme sprigs if using (fresh or dried). Season with salt to taste.",
    "Pour in the prepared kosher cream sauce mix. Bring mixture to a simmer.",
    "Add butter last, stirring gently until everything is well combined and smooth.",
    "Reduce heat and let cook for an additional 5 minutes, allowing flavors to meld together."
  ],
